sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as maas-default-gateway<br/>(openshift-ingress)<br/>Gateway API
    participant AuthPolicy as Kuadrant/Authorino<br/>AuthPolicy
    participant API as maas-api<br/>8080/TCP (Gin)
    participant K8sAuth as Kubernetes API<br/>TokenReview + SAR
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>(maas-db-config)
    participant Controller as maas-controller<br/>Reconcilers
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>LLMInferenceService

    Note over Client,KServe: External API Request Flow (e.g., /v1/models)

    Client->>Gateway: HTTPS/8443<br/>POST /v1/models<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / API Key
    Gateway->>AuthPolicy: Enforce AuthPolicy<br/>(API key + TokenReview + OIDC JWT)
    AuthPolicy-->>Gateway: Auth result
    Gateway->>API: HTTPRoute forward<br/>URL rewrite strips /maas-api prefix
    API->>K8sAuth: TokenReview<br/>Validate bearer token
    K8sAuth-->>API: Token valid
    API->>K8sAuth: SubjectAccessReview<br/>Confirm cluster membership
    K8sAuth-->>API: Access granted
    API->>DB: Query models/subscriptions<br/>(pgx connection)
    DB-->>API: Result set
    API-->>Gateway: JSON Response
    Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over Client,KServe: API Key Management Flow

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/api-keys<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>AuthPolicy: Enforce AuthPolicy
    AuthPolicy-->>Gateway: Auth result
    Gateway->>API: Forward request
    API->>K8sAuth: TokenReview + SAR
    K8sAuth-->>API: Authorized
    API->>DB: Store/retrieve API key
    DB-->>API: Confirmation
    API-->>Gateway: API key response
    Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over Controller,KServe: Controller Reconciliation Flow

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch MaaS CRDs<br/>(AITenant, MaaSModelRef,<br/>MaaSSubscription, MaaSAuthPolicy)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Resource events

    Controller->>KServe: Conditional watch<br/>LLMInferenceService<br/>(if CRD exists)
    KServe-->>Controller: Model serving state

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update<br/>Kuadrant AuthPolicy
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update<br/>TokenRateLimitPolicy
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update<br/>HTTPRoutes, Namespaces,<br/>ConfigMaps, Secrets

    Note over Client,KServe: Health Probes (Unauthenticated)

    Client->>API: GET /health (8080)<br/>No auth required
    API-->>Client: 200 OK
    Client->>Controller: GET /healthz (8081)<br/>No auth required
    Controller-->>Client: 200 OK
